// and the interned constant-vector base pool index past u8, requiring the
// wide SKIP_M form -- see pkg/zkc/vm/internal/interpreter/encoding/switch.go.
// This is currently unreachable end-to-end: switch codegen merges every
// case's exit through a single vectorised arithmetic instruction, one
